# Containment Priest: "If a nontoken creature would enter and it wasn't cast, exile it instead." Corpse Dance does not cast the
# creature, so Bot2's Priest exiles Bot1's Ornithopter as it would enter (CR 614.1a). The creature never reaches the battlefield, so
# it gains no haste and nothing is waiting to exile it at the end step; Corpse Dance goes to the graveyard (no buyback).

